{"id":"wx2652830606","title":"提问！谁见过华农这张SSR","published_at":"2025-03-12T19:36:11+08:00","published_label":"2025-03-12","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqLhjwfsg4Gk5R4G3u5MVJ2nicicuJReeDRYWicG055lrH5juiav9NxtpJaA/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"三月的华农 不仅有烂漫花海令人陶醉 绿美树木也大有乾坤 它们或历史悠久，见证岁月变迁 或珍贵稀有，承载独特价值 想象偌大的华农校园是一本游戏地图 漫步其中，偶遇的树木便犹如一张张道具卡牌 今天是第47个植树节 带你“抽卡 ” 识树！…","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652830606&idx=1&sn=6534feabc26eedb8adf2cb1bbeada979","paper_url":null,"word_count":2940,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:42:59+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPknEibMf4Uo8CQXCjxfPMCK0bH1LUP02sicTX6l7xja7licFNg6joVtCfw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>三月的华农</span></section><section><span>不仅有烂漫花海令人陶醉</span></section><section><span>绿美树木也大有乾坤</span></section><section><span>它们或历史悠久，见证岁月变迁</span></section><section><span>或珍贵稀有，承载独特价值</span></section><section><span>想象偌大的华农校园是一本游戏地图</span></section><section><span>漫步其中，偶遇的树木便犹如一张张道具卡牌<br/></span></section><section><span>今天是第47个植树节</span></section><section><span>带你“抽卡<span>”</span>识树！</span></section><section><span><span>同时，学校还迎来</span><span>了一批树木新成员</span></span></section><section><span><span>跟着镜头，<span>一探究</span><span>竟</span></span></span></section><p><span><span><span>👇👇👇</span></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>植树节，去植树！</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPBmNtbKHcej027xo8dLeia9eAMtj6PtupXQia5GjyM7a9uTfapia68XfKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>点击视频，回顾种树现场！</span></p><p><span>为深入推进绿美广东生态建设，打造绿色生态校园，3月12日上午，学校和五山街道办事处联合开展义务植树活动，在体育馆、人才公寓种植桉树、小叶榄仁、紫花风铃木等305棵。树木均由五山街道和华农校友捐赠。</span></p><section><span>校党委书记李凤亮、校长薛红卫，校党政领导班子成员，校董事会和教育发展基金会成员，五山街道负责人出席活动。</span></section><section><span>同时，学校发出植树倡议书，</span><strong><span><span>诚邀广大校友、师生及社会各界人士捐赠、认领校内树木</span></span></strong><span>，详细内容请点击👉<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzNDU3MDI4Mg==&amp;mid=2247498515&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b14e3c260922d30b1a329891f2fa1483&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">倡议书 | 共建绿色华农，同绘生态未来</a></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>华农SSR级的树！你见过吗？</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPBmNtbKHcej027xo8dLeia9eAMtj6PtupXQia5GjyM7a9uTfapia68XfKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><span>据不完全统计</span><br/></section><p><span>华农校内有植物种类近千种</span></p><p><span>更是有树木园这座</span></p><p><span>占地约150亩的“植物宝库”</span></p><p><span>其中既有常见的绿化行道树<br/></span></p><p><span>也有不少</span><span>品种珍稀、饱含深意的名树古木</span></p><p><span>如果以同学们熟悉的游戏抽卡比喻</span></p><p><span>一进校门看到的树是R级（普通稀有）</span></p><p><span>那SR级（比较稀有）和SSR级（非常稀有）</span></p><section><span>又会是怎样的呢？</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>R级！你一定见过它们</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqZ05gdYC59XDP2tXektaJOJWrr201qeRic1Gt4waeUyVKRjIzPukwg6Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong> 大王椰子树</strong></p></section></section></section><p><span>地点：西南门道路两旁、竹园宾馆前</span></p><section><section><span>简介：大王椰子树树形优美，广泛作行道树和庭园绿化树种；果实含油，可作猪饲料。不过，作为观赏树木的大王椰是不长椰子的。从西南门一走进华农校园，便能看到道路两旁高大的大王椰子树，为学校营造出浓浓的亚热带氛围，是许多学子入学留下的第一个“华农印象”。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqq3eXpzDlH2hCgia31vbX8RXrLYTrDSL5Jxdjwvunsy4DqAMsBicpbv3w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong> 柠檬桉</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span>地点：红满堂和农博馆中间道路两旁</span></section></section><p><span>简介：又称“靓仔桉”，是桃金娘科桉属常绿大乔木，也是南方重要的速生用材树种和很好的芳香树种。很多师生夏天路过红满堂附近闻到的清新气味，就是自柠檬桉而来。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqCrFHEWbEwbTRMXpI1v1As5IBulo0DSiaUeMic5bDlNrCRto35nXbFFxg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span> 非洲桃花心木</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span>地点：行政楼和绿榕园之间的道路</span></p><section><p><span>简介：是一种乔木，高达20米，我国台湾、广东、及海南等地有栽培，原产于非洲热带地区和马达加斯加，常用于高档家具和乐器制作，是世界名贵木材之一。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqpbuIsNryUFtonfz9MYXMe4F36gibrYadYSV7I6fSDTX4ckHmCcKI4ww/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p> <span><strong>南洋杉</strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span>地点：酸奶文化馆通往西南门的山坡小道两旁</span></p><section><p><span>简介：是一种乔木，球果卵圆形或椭圆形，种子椭圆形，两侧具结合而生的薄翅，木材可供建筑、器具、家具等用，也可栽培作盆栽植物观赏。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>SR级！它的故事，你知道吗</strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWq8UHBf7ZuqxRzoatL9H8FCFicsZN8eUD72w3FofC6QFgjkPAsqCZibcug/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></p><section><section><section><p> <span><strong>蓝花楹</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：教一门前</span></section><section><section><span>简介：蓝花楹是一种落叶乔木，花呈蓝色，观赏性强。木材黄白色至灰色，质软而轻，纹理通直，加工容易，可作家具用材。教一楼前原来种植的凤凰木因病倒伏后，学校又在原址重新补种了一棵凤凰木，并在不远处又种了一棵蓝花楹，期望每年蓝花楹与凤凰木同时开放，明艳火红的凤凰花与清雅浪漫的蓝花相映成趣，成就新一道美丽的风景。</span></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqGSfHpqmYGNPR130SzbibyFia5gRFzj6ef0Ha1E9TpYia4cQTbnUIhvXsA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>高山榕</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：工程学院院楼附近</span></section><section><span>简介：高山榕是大乔木，叶薄革质，树色深灰。榕树气生根发达，一向以其“身躯”之庞大，为人称道。位于工程学院附近的这课高山榕独木成林，气势非凡，也是学校最大的榕树。</span></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqvGQpC7w2AlANQCl7prST0Vl8QFv24N5wSu9vhksKTHtdHCVoY2Kozg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong>任豆</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：树木园、紫荆桥桥头</span></section><section><section><span>简介：任豆已入选中国生物多样性红色名录。任豆的拉丁文是“Zenia insignis Chun”，其“Chun”表明此物由华农十二院士之一的陈焕镛院士命名，而属名“Zenia”则来自任鸿隽的韦氏拼音，这是陈焕镛为感谢著名学者任鸿隽对他从事植物研究资助而命名的。</span></section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqTPBvthWUBDTsZ0QiaCa76rMHHbHpJvWJ2wqdVUohEXGQApPCS2XHJkQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p> <strong>观光木</strong></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：90周年纪念树园（教三附近）</span></section><section><p><span>简介：观光木的濒危等级为易危，是中国的特有种。为纪念钟观光先生对我国植物学研究作出的突出贡献，陈焕镛院士将这一发现的新属新种，命名为观光木。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>SSR级！有空去打个卡吧</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqhAoANibhLQ98ibS2SrrmhsibvVfCo1B4TVqElF2FWNPF4nFzqfrnHnbJA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><section><section><p> <strong>樟树</strong></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：竹铭草海（即教三大草坪）</span></section><section><p><span>简介：樟树木材及根、枝、叶可提取樟脑和樟油，木材又为造船、橱箱和建筑等用材。竹铭草海的这棵樟树是学校最老的树之一，目前已有140多岁的高龄，见证着华农的前世今生。2021年的校友返校日，1991届蚕学毕业生值毕业30周年之际，专门向母校捐赠一块“百年香樟”纪念石，由华农退休教师、著名书法家梁鼎光题字。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPCJFIIJA1pABLTjvnXJN8IEsYR933MOs6qBWSeDt4IcRPqQhmdvFWdA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>降香黄檀</strong></p></section></section></section><p><span>地点：5号楼附近</span></p><section><section><span>简介：降香黄檀，被广州市人民政府列入重点保护的古树名木，是华农校园里最名贵的树种之一。降香木材质优，边材淡黄色，质略疏松，心材红褐色，坚重，纹理致密，为上等家具良材；有香味，可作香料；根部心材名降香，供药用，为良好的镇痛剂，又治刀伤出血。</span></section><p><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8yFIp99mCpdia6EUgic9KiaWqtlaRdLqia7JR4lK8ia4E8fsFW0vgGbTgPyJQnpKsdg5zp9s0rib7LuyNw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p> <strong>柚木</strong></p></section></section></section><section><span>地点：洪泽湖畔旁</span></section><section><section><span>简介：柚木是著名木材之一，光泽美丽，纹理通直，耐朽力强，芳香，适于造船、车辆、建筑、雕刻及家具之用。1955年，周恩来总理参加万隆会议时，时任印度尼西亚总统苏加诺赠与了周总理一包柚木种子，这一包见证了万隆精神的种子被周总理带回国内，并在来粤视察期间交予时任广东省领导，几经转手，最终由华南农学院（现华南农业大学）造林学教研室副教授罗长绵带领苗圃工人育苗，并种植在了洪泽湖畔。据了解，这也是华农校园内目前唯一的柚木群。</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>绿美广东，华农力量</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPBmNtbKHcej027xo8dLeia9eAMtj6PtupXQia5GjyM7a9uTfapia68XfKw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>近年来，华农聚焦广东生态文明建设面临的“痛点”“堵点”和“难点”问题，把深入服务绿美广东生态建设作为学校“双一流”建设的重要任务，以农业科技创新、农村科技服务和涉农人才培养为抓手，在传播生态思想、发展生态农业、开展生态规划等方面下真功苦功细功，探索出一条一流农业高校服务绿美广东生态建设、助力乡村全面振兴的新路径。</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>实践创新服务绿美广东</span></span><span>。</span></strong><span>林学与风景园林学院专门选派专家团队服务绿美广东工作专班，组织林学、风景园林、城乡规划等相关专业教师在深入广东各地镇村开展乡村绿化规划、种植、管护、“美丽庭院”建设等专题培训，2024年培训农户和技术人员近万人次。</span></p><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXP9M0ESXY4qu0q9FxomU3kzq314B7kVJuwZ9JrqXaVckFAjB1dvxjoMQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><strong><span>科技创新引领绿色发展。</span></strong><span>加强科技成果转化，推广种植自主研发的华桉3号、紫娟等林木新品种，创新解决“种什么”的问题。积极转化松材线虫防控技术、马尾松角胫象引诱剂等管护方面的新技术新成果，科学解决“怎么种”“怎么管”的问题。</span></section><section><strong><span><span><span>教学创新培养绿美人才。</span></span></span></strong><span><span>通过组织“绿美感觉乡村”主题征文大赛、“绿植种植”主题科普节、“绿化科技”创客大赛等活动，加强绿色生态思想政治教育。瞄准高层次林业人才缺口，大胆创新研究生人才培养模式，学校2024年推行并招收了第一届研究生专项班“绿美广东专项创新班<span>”</span>，为长期推动绿美广东生态建设和乡村绿化工作提供稳定持续高质量的人才支持。</span></span></section></section><section><section><span>这里有新苗茁壮成长</span></section><section><span>也有老树亘古长青</span></section><section><span>这里有年轮镌刻百年历史</span></section><section><span>也有枝桠聆听动人故事</span></section><section><span>我们在这里书写树木的秘密</span></section><section><span>开展绿美广东生态建设</span></section><section><span>共同绘制独属于华农的绿美画卷</span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>往期回顾</strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652830330&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=47af2f0ee7ec50764a2b59e4063bf3c4&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPeGNMkHj6CwuPGicXQBU5ITxumz3hT0OvVMe8oMic3we3HiaUGwaJhiadUA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><strong>/ </strong></span>他们的风采，靓过花开！<span> <strong>/</strong></span></p></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652829773&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c12fe001985c5549352f5854e2374cd7&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPaVoVdIwl6ia1XGZ8Aiaq5YRY0icm2Pic8FNzapnhVoLHvicKX7BzWcJmnAw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><strong>/ </strong></span>摊牌了，华农学子确实去种田了！<strong><span>/</span></strong></p></section></section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652827911&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=7d5d6b66a0ee9452def1f757fa79aa93&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><section><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPT4EkEft3VZw51DVU0Re4ZMcjLGzxgKyynMicicjVuqwNFJQ4lRjzA8sQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></a><section><section><p><span><strong>/ </strong></span>春天，就是反复爱上华农的过程！<strong><span>/</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXP5mehcwIsGYtZqNhcmTBqS5YC892Nwqia2iblmxEOV6SqQaWSicBAfibS5A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section>-SCAU-</section><section><span>专业顾问 | 吴永彬</span></section><section><span>资料来源<span> | 林学与风景园林学院 总务部 中国植物志</span></span></section><section><span>整理 | 新禾融媒体工作室 李湘君 邱盈月</span></section><section><span>图 | 新禾融媒体工作室 王奕瑾 往期图库</span></section><section>编辑 | 新禾融媒体工作室 李湘君 邱盈月 <span>罗嘉淇</span></section><section>初审 | 费思迎</section><section>复审 | 陈芃辰</section><section>终审 | 钟耿涛</section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>“</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXP6f0whct1eZq0UicAojZt5lM7JxWFGs1HQuLH3t77xRKbicaapbwfeib6g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>”</span><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p>扫码关注，获取华农最新资讯</p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc9GE6Rga6yxevia18JJRAkXPiaamml3QN4QDexzW2iayREylEJIyrZBbojT5KohCxZZIenibicBn5NrdzA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>左下</strong><strong>点击标签阅读更多，右下点赞、分享、推荐支持！</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></div>"}
